cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you refer to this work, please cite the paper. When the exact bytes of the
  formal development matter, also cite the archived Zenodo version you used.
title: >-
  A Theoretical Study of DBLog: paper sources and Isabelle/HOL formal
  development
abstract: >-
  Information hub for the paper "A Theoretical Study of DBLog: Certified Virtual
  Cuts for a Snapshot-Equivalent Replay of Live Databases". Contains the paper
  sources as posted to arXiv and the machine-checked Isabelle/HOL development
  DBLog_Virtual_Cuts, byte-identical to its archived Zenodo deposit.
